OL,4,CMyanmar refuses to comply with parts   
OL,5,Cof ICJ genocide ruling                 
OL,6,GMyanmar will not comply with           
OL,7,G"inappropriate" parts of the genocide  
OL,8,Gruling by the International Court of   
OL,9,GJustice (ICJ), its leader Min Aung     
OL,10,GHlaing has said in his first public    
OL,11,Gcomments since the court decision.     
OL,13,FThe ICJ's landmark ruling last week    
OL,14,Ffound Myanmar guilty of committing     
OL,15,Fgenocide against its Rohingya minority 
OL,16,Fin a 2017 military crackdown that      
OL,17,Fkilled thousands and forced more than  
OL,18,F700,000 to flee.                       
